<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>Chardok Epic Raid!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Author: Mubbo Littlefury<br><br>I did not post the results of our Chardok Royals raid and would like to take the opportunity to thank everyone who participated it was a marginal success. <br><br>(shameless plug time)<br>I would also like to urge all those 50 and above to sign up for the next Chardok raid that will be taking place on February 23rd. The sole purpose of this raid is to get the Queen for the warrior epic weapons.<br><br>The raid started out a little bumpy as Gornaire decided to have a tasty Bard Snack(tm) and then went on to have a little snack on a couple other people coming out to attend the raid.<br><br>Once we finally got assembled, organized a COH we left the straglers..erm..stragling to start the raid. Borgir did his best to pull ferociously so that we could quickly invade the deepest reaches of Chardok.<br><br>We payed a visit to the Prince of Chardok and for fun hacked his ugly head off and gave it as a "booby" prize to Aurah, why on earth she was so happy to recieve a bloody head is anyones guess..magic users..go figure.<br><br>We then made our way down to the King and Queens ante room where we easily dispatched their courtiers and prepared to battle the King himself. He put up a valiant fight but was unable to stem the flow from a zillion wounds that we inflicted upon his person. Depp kept yelling out "Don't damage his Breast Plate!!" over and over, I mean come on you have 20 odd people hacking away at a guy and he is worried about a stinky blood covered incardine breastplate..sheesh! Well congratulations anyway Depp on your slightly used (sorry about all the holes in the back) Incardine Breastplate, the Over King wont need it anymore anyway. <br><br>Unfortunately we didnt have the fire power to take out the Over Kings beloved wife, I am hoping that on our next visit to the kingdom of Chardok we will have enough people to make her pay and pay and pay again. <br><br>Oh and I almost forgot that Euenyil Eveningtide needed something or other that the King has for some quest or something..I don't know..something about a wet noodle..Im just a Rogue after all, what do I know about Magic.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      